From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rxodin <rxodin@localhost>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 13:01:13 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: pmi8998_fg: register the battery as "battery"

ROCKNIX tools read /sys/class/power_supply/battery, same as the RK3399/RK3588 battery-name patches.
---
 drivers/power/supply/pmi8998_fg.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/pmi8998_fg.c b/drivers/power/supply/pmi8998_fg.c
index 4bad622..bc4ec1d 100644
--- a/drivers/power/supply/pmi8998_fg.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/pmi8998_fg.c
@@ -386,7 +386,7 @@ static int pmi8998_fg_get_property(struct power_supply *psy,
 }
 
 static const struct power_supply_desc batt_psy_desc = {
-	.name = "qcom-battery",
+	.name = "battery",
 	.type = POWER_SUPPLY_TYPE_BATTERY,
 	.properties = pmi8998_fg_props,
 	.num_properties = ARRAY_SIZE(pmi8998_fg_props),
